OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister urges Burnham to be
OL,4,Aserious about Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelsh First Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,7,Fhas urged the prime minister to show he
OL,8,Fis serious about Wales ahead of a
OL,9,Fmeeting between the pair in Scotland.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham is joining ap Iorwerth and
OL,12,FScottish First Minister John Swinney in
OL,13,FGlasgow on Friday for a National
OL,14,FEconomic Council meeting.
OL,16,FBefore the meeting, ap Iorwerth said he
OL,17,Fassumed Burnham was holding something
OL,18,Fback after a UK government Budget that
OL,19,Fhad "little mention" of Wales.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
